.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH rev-stealth-config-profile-list 1  "rev-stealth-config-profile-list " 
.SH NAME
rev\-stealth\-config\-profile\-list \- List every profile directory under `<base>/profiles/`
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBrev\-stealth config profile list\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
List every profile directory under <base>/profiles/. Output is the bare set of profile names (no metadata).
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.SH EXTRA
EXAMPLES:
  $ rev\-stealth config profile list
  $ rev\-stealth config \-\-output\-format json profile list

EXIT CODES:
  0  Ok               Listing emitted.
  1  UserError        Bad args.
  3  PermanentError   directory IO failure.

ENV:
  REV_SCRAPING_PROFILES_ROOT   Override the profiles root directory.
